title V1 - Basic local RAG
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Data sources [color: gray] {
  Wikipedia articles [icon: file-text]
  arXiv PDFs [icon: file]
  NASA images and captions [icon: image]
}

Ingestion [color: green] {
  Loaders [icon: upload]
  Chunker 1200 chars [icon: scissors]
  Embedder nomic-embed-text [icon: cpu]
}

Postgres pgvector [shape: cylinder, icon: database, color: blue]

Query path [color: purple] {
  User [icon: user]
  Chat CLI [icon: terminal]
  Query embedder [icon: cpu]
  Top-6 cosine search [icon: search]
  Image boost [icon: image]
  LLM qwen3-4b-instruct [icon: message-circle]
}

Wikipedia articles > Loaders
arXiv PDFs > Loaders
NASA images and captions > Loaders
Loaders > Chunker 1200 chars
Chunker 1200 chars > Embedder nomic-embed-text
Embedder nomic-embed-text > Postgres pgvector: vectors + text + metadata

User > Chat CLI: question
Chat CLI > Query embedder
Query embedder > Top-6 cosine search
Top-6 cosine search <> Postgres pgvector
Top-6 cosine search > Image boost: picture questions
Image boost > LLM qwen3-4b-instruct: sources + prompt
LLM qwen3-4b-instruct > User: answer + citations
